[0.030, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"result\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"`big.txt` is a 679-entry development log for a library room booking app, kept by a team of eight students, that records each dated change (bug fixes, tests, refactors, reviews, deployments) with the person, module, and a short status note.\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
